    "original": "This character has cursed a victim to suffer all the pain inflicted upon this character - a strong deterrent against those who would have hostile intentions.",
    "translation": "该角色诅咒了一名受害者，使其遭受施加到自己身上的所有痛苦 ———— 一种对怀有敌意者的强大威慑。",
